IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cadda-duties`

-- Countervailing and Anti-Dumping Duties Act 1996, ss 2(1), 3(2), 4(8), 6, 8, 9, 12(7), 13, 14, 15(3), 19(8), 20, 22, 23, 24, 25(9)(c), 26(7), 27, 33(5), 42, 45 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_countervailing-and-anti-dumping-duties-act-1996.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

